{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Roared</b> — The sanctuaries are called <i>mo'adim</i> because of the assembly of Israel there at the appointed seasons. Similarly: \"They burned all the meeting-places of El in the land\" (Psalms 74:8)." "<b>And their signs</b> — According to their intent, in the manner of: \"and the men pursued after them\" (Joshua 2:5)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 74, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:24.698072131Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}